  "version": 1,
  "rule": "Default deny. A hit may be classified PAGE_ORIGIN only if its source is under mayCarryPageText; every other source or table is LEAK (SOURCE_NOT_ALLOWED) without a provenance check. mustNotCarryPageText names every other table explicitly so a new table forces a decision (leakscan.test.ts compares this file with the CREATE TABLE statements of backend/src/main/resources/db/migration). Widening mayCarryPageText needs a recorded decision.",
